stem:
What is the value of \(\left| \begin{matrix}
    \sin 10^{o} & - \cos 10^{o} \\
    \sin 80^{o} & {cos\ }80^{o}
    \end{matrix} \right|\ ?\)

solution:
\(\left| \begin{matrix}
    \sin 10^{o} & - \cos 10^{o} \\
    \sin 80^{o} & \cos 80^{o}
    \end{matrix} \right|\)\
    = \(\sin 10^{o}\cos 80^{o} + \cos 10^{o}\sin 80^{o}\)\
    = \(\sin\left( 10^{o} + 80^{o} \right) = \sin 90^{o} = 1\)

